			"notes": "Two jars: `+mc26.1.2` for Minecraft 26.1.2, `+mc26.2` for 26.2 (untested in game).\n\n**New**\n\n- Shard value per run, priced off the bazaar\n- Shards counted per species, not just totals\n- Instant sell by default, sell offer, or both side by side\n- Value line on the progress HUD, under the biome bars\n- Run tab: coins this run, and coins an hour\n- History tab: Coins column, and the total\n- Stats tab: total coins, coins a run, runs priced\n- `/critters prices` — refresh by hand, breakdown by species, both sides\n- Profit settings category: on/off, price side, bazaar tax, HUD line\n- `/critters import` backfills old runs' shards so they can be priced\n\n**Fixed**\n\n- `/critters import` no longer duplicates runs that were tracked live"
